{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":17470,\"title\":\"Arc\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Set in the belly of Los Angeles' criminal underworld, Arc is the story of Paris Pritchert, a former police officer turned drug dealer and addict, who embarks on a quest to find a missing child in the hope of redeeming his eroding character. The only catch is, like all addicts, Paris' confidence completely relies on the drugs in his system and -- in this case -- his firm belief that he can succeed in his mission if he can just stay high 24/7 and alive long enough to see it through. To aid in the endeavor, Paris enlists the help of Maya Gibbs, an African American prostitute versed not only in the language of the street, but also in the words of Maya Angelou and Nadine Gordimer. And together, the path of this dysfunctional duo crosses with those of the child's parents, a doctor with a penchant for soliciting \\\"Street Boys\\\", a self-ascribed King Of Porn, a drug supplier with a gift for making impeccable hors d'oeuvres, and a hardened cop with more scams than the most adept street hustler.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/u89zkqN6Mv3NiNuUeM7Qjqbwu8r.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/41tnzOX5rHdrOuMwFDlq1KSNW62.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"voteCount\":10,\"year\":2006,\"runtime\":113,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":650000,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Robert Ethan Gunnerson\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":81910,\"name\":\"Robert Ethan Gunnerson\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":56857,\"name\":\"Peter Facinelli\",\"character\":\"Paris\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mmha3A5INmromiCsN8FBSLScVpZ.jpg\"},{\"id\":59260,\"name\":\"Ann Cusack\",\"character\":\"Angela Blake\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vM2ZwKY3C1NZARrzQB7ch7n638T.jpg\"},{\"id\":53814,\"name\":\"Jonah Blechman\",\"character\":\"Kenny\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ngp1PfWI3cqwhEALZDDJVFxhdbH.jpg\"},{\"id\":18328,\"name\":\"Ken Howard\",\"character\":\"Santee\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/YYMWMAqp6dpd18PIbo0aLiIabg.jpg\"},{\"id\":117167,\"name\":\"Billy Lush\",\"character\":\"Bobby Ward\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AaBYif3S889qOxXYnPZ4TAoYUWt.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":9963,\"title\":\"Premonition\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vKW1XIYrIqVrbCaYj9FQDHKXR8R.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/esXYvlivZ8j0HGqob949CIjqnGi.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A depressed housewife who learns her husband was killed in a car accident the day previously awakens the next morning to find him alive and well at home, and then awakens the day after to a world in which he is still dead.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":210577,\"title\":\"Gone Girl\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ts996lKsxvjkO2yiYG0ht4qAicO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iWak7wT0j6ycCc8lKr4NBz9c7n5.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"With his wife's disappearance having become the focus of an intense media circus, a man sees the spotlight turned on him when it's suspected that he may not be innocent.\",\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":11324,\"title\":\"Shutter Island\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nrmXQ0zcZUL8jFLrakWc90IR8z9.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lavdyiJWciCJvyLG37ZOs6HJijg.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"World War II soldier-turned-U.S. Marshal Teddy Daniels investigates the disappearance of a patient from a hospital for the criminally insane, but his efforts are compromised by troubling visions and a mysterious doctor.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",