://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/157QuwzU58D5RtXmkBl5iNaxigN.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Barcelona, Spain. Adrián Doria, a young and successful businessman accused of murder, meets one night with Virginia Goodman, an expert interrogation lawyer, in order to devise a defense strategy.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1050035,\"title\":\"Monster\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iw1G1iTGOA30f4bT49IDKumCcpF.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dZJcOyRonN0Kb7kJR3DE3esGn16.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After an outburst at school involving her son, a concerned single mother demands answers, triggering a sequence of deepening suspicion and turmoil.\",\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":322,\"title\":\"Mystic River\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hCHVDbo6XJGj3r2i4hVjKhE0GKF.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4ycpMe25LYpzGW42U9amyW9gM53.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The lives of three men who were childhood friends are shattered when one of them suffers a family tragedy.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":491584,\"title\":\"Burning\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kXiF80o74fE9gf3Utf9moAI7ar0.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qQEt2FqF8McryFBNX30dyDJKiEK.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Deliveryman Jong-su is out on a job when he runs into Hae-mi, a girl who once lived in his neighborhood. She asks if he'd mind looking after her cat while she's away on a trip to Africa. On her return, she introduces to Jong-su an enigmatic young man named Ben, who she met during her trip. One day Ben tells Jong-su about his most unusual hobby.\",\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null}